   "start": 0.32,
   "text": "The small intestine runs from the pyloric sphincter to the ileocecal valve. First comes the duodenum, only half a meter long. Then the jejunum, two to three meters, and the ileum, three to four. About 90% of carbohydrate and protein digestion, and essentially all fat digestion is finished in the first two parts."
  }
 ],
 "text": "The small intestine runs from the pyloric sphincter to the ileocecal valve. First comes the duodenum, only half a meter long. Then the jejunum, two to three meters, and the ileum, three to four. About 90% of carbohydrate and protein digestion, and essentially all fat digestion is finished in the first two parts."
